<caml:Content xmlns:caml="http://lc.ca.gov/legalservices/schemas/caml.1#"><p>(a)<span class="EnSpace"/>It shall be unlawful for any person to act as a service contractor in this state unless that person first registers with the bureau in accordance with the provisions of this chapter and maintains a valid registration.</p><p>(b)<span class="EnSpace"/>Except as expressly provided in this chapter, service contractors registered in accordance with the provisions of this chapter shall be exempt from all provisions of the Insurance Code.</p></caml:Content>